          "children": [
            {
              "key": "world-1",
              "type": "Article",
              "title": "Cities race to plant a million trees",
              "slug": "million-trees",
              "seo_description": "Urban forests are back on the agenda as summers get hotter.",
              "in_menu": true,
              "data": {
                "standfirst": "Urban forests are back on the agenda as summers get hotter.",
                "published": "2026-11-02",
                "author": "Sam Rivera",
                "featured": true,
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Across dozens of cities, councils are setting tree-planting targets that would have seemed absurd a decade ago.</p><p>The reason is simple: shade lowers street temperatures by several degrees.</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "quote",
                    "value": {
                      "text": "Every tree is a small air conditioner that also cleans the air.",
                      "attribution": "Sam Rivera"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Critics say maintenance budgets lag behind the planting promises.</p>"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "cover": "@media:leaves"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "world-2",
              "type": "Article",
              "title": "Night trains return to the timetable",
              "slug": "night-trains-return",
              "seo_description": "Sleeper services reopen routes that closed twenty years ago.",
              "in_menu": true,
              "data": {
                "standfirst": "Sleeper services reopen routes that closed twenty years ago.",
                "published": "2026-10-30",
                "author": "Priya Shah",
                "featured": false,
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Rail operators are bringing back overnight routes between capitals.</p><p>Demand is driven by travellers who want to avoid short flights.</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "quote",
                    "value": {
                      "text": "You go to sleep in one country and wake up in another.",
                      "attribution": "Priya Shah"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Tickets for the first season sold out within days.</p>"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "cover": "@media:city"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "tech",
          "type": "Section",
          "title": "Technology",
          "slug": "technology",
          "in_menu": true,
          "data": {
            "intro": "Tools, software and the people who build them."
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "key": "tech-1",
              "type": "Article",
              "title": "Small teams, big releases",
              "slug": "small-teams-big-releases",
              "seo_description": "How two-person teams are shipping products used by millions.",
              "in_menu": true,
              "data": {
                "standfirst": "How two-person teams are shipping products used by millions.",
                "published": "2026-11-01",
                "author": "Lee Chen",
                "featured": true,
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>A new generation of tools lets very small teams build and run large products.</p><p>The common thread is ruthless focus on a single problem.</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "quote",
                    "value": {
                      "text": "We don't hire to grow; we hire when it hurts.",
                      "attribution": "Lee Chen"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Not every founder wants a big company, and that is changing the industry.</p>"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "cover": "@media:circuit"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "tech-2",
              "type": "Article",
              "title": "The quiet comeback of the personal website",
              "slug": "personal-website-comeback",
              "seo_description": "Tired of feeds, people are building small sites of their own again.",
              "in_menu": true,
              "data": {
                "standfirst": "Tired of feeds, people are building small sites of their own again.",
                "published": "2026-10-25",
                "author": "Ana Ruiz",
                "featured": false,
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Personal websites are having a moment as people look for a calmer corner of the internet.</p><p>A simple page with your writing and work is still the best business card.</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "quote",
                    "value": {
                      "text": "Own your words, and the place where people find them.",
                      "attribution": "Ana Ruiz"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "value": {
                      "body": "<p>Hosting has never been cheaper, and good tools make it easy.</p>"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "cover": "@media:studio"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "culture",
          "type": "Section",
          "title": "Culture",
